r.\n\nThus candidate C seems best overall. Agent_2 originally favored A due to technical and leadership, but now sees that C's reliability and crew-focused attitude may outweigh A's interpersonal issues. The main tradeoff: A's strong anticipatory and leadership vs C's communication issues and lack of development. Considering long-distance flights, crew cohesion and calmness are critical. C's calmness and reliability are crucial. So Agent_2 may shift to Candidate C.\n\nWe need to produce public message summarizing current position, evidence, alternatives, tradeoff, uncertainties, what would change vote, confidence. Provide METADATA_JSON with vote \"Candidate C\". Ensure we reference evidence from others.\n\nLet's craft."}
